# Build output
/build/

# Balance harness output (#283): `make balance` writes its JSON report into the
# repo root, and a hand-run `go build ./cmd/balance` drops the binary there too.
# Anchored so cmd/balance/ itself is never matched.
/balance
/balance-report.json

